 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le10ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How much should we play for?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How about for the money you already owe me?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Amy I forgot to ask, you invited a few of your friends to come out tonight, right?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Yeah, Jane, who works in my office, wasn't feeling well yesterday. She must have caught a cold, so she didn't want to come out and my other friend Terri didn't answer the phone when I called her. She must have fallen asleep.</br >", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le10ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "22500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I talked to Jose about coming out, but he might have forgotten. </br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: He can't have forgotten. I sent him a text earlier tonight and he said he would make an appearance.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe he decided to stay at home because the weather is dreadful. </br >\nYeah, I just got a text from him. He said he is going to take a raincheck.</br >", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le10ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "40000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Good. I hope everyone stays home because the snow doesn't look like it's letting up.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter, do you remember Sally's birthday party when no one showed up?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sadly.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Oh no! What happened?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally had a birthday party planned at a restaurant on a Saturday because she thought people wouldn't come to a party on that Sunday which was her actual birthday.</br >", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le10ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "61500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She made up a big list of people, sent out invitations to everyone and booked a restaurant. It was going to be a gala evening.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: But nobody came Saturday because she had mixed up the dates on the invitations.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Ohhh! Poor girl! As she was sitting there, wondering where her friends were, she must have felt pretty dejected.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She said initially, she was feeling pretty irate since no one had come to her party that she worked so hard on to plan.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: What did she do?</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She started phoning people and she quickly figured out the mistake. We were able to rebook the next day at nearly the same time, so it all worked out.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Alright I'm ready. Let's play some \u2026 oh no!</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The power is out!</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yep, it's a blackout!", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le10ob09re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le10ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le10ob09re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}